#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:46
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Off mode does"
msgid "Passes the sound through exactly as it arrives."
msgstr "声音原样通过，不做任何改变。"

#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:49
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Gentle mode does"
msgid ""
"Takes the edge off the loudest moments. Hard to hear working, which suits "
"music."
msgstr "削弱最响的瞬间。几乎听不出它在起作用，适合音乐。"

#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:52
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Moderate mode does"
msgid ""
"Brings loud and quiet passages closer together, for films and games at low "
"volume."
msgstr "拉近响亮与安静段落之间的差距，适合以低音量看电影和玩游戏。"

#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:55
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Heavy mode does"
msgid ""
"Holds the level firmly, so quiet details come up close to the loud ones."
msgstr "牢牢控制电平，让安静的细节接近响亮的部分。"

#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:58
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Voice mode does"
msgid ""
"Keeps a voice steady and close, catching each loud syllable as it starts."
msgstr "让人声平稳而贴近，在每个响亮音节刚开始时就将其压住。"

#: app/qml/CompressorWords.qml:61
msgctxt "@info what the Simple Compressor's Broadcast mode does"
msgid ""
"Dense and even, like a radio station: nothing stands out and nothing drops "
"away."
msgstr "密实而均匀，就像电台一样：没有什么特别突出，也没有什么消失不见。"

