msgid "no sound"
msgstr "无声音"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:132
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "below compression"
msgstr "未达压缩"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "compressing"
msgstr "压缩中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:136
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "gate lowering"
msgstr "噪声门降低中"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says it is doing"
msgid "at the ceiling"
msgstr "已达上限"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:140
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says while its session is stopped"
msgid "Not playing"
msgstr "未播放"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:142
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Compressor tile says when switched off"
msgid "Switched off"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor"
msgid "No sound coming in"
msgstr "没有声音输入"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor"
msgid "Below compression, nothing taken off"
msgstr "未达压缩，无削减"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:156
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor, 'Taking off 6.2 dB'"
msgid "Taking off %1 dB"
msgstr "正在削减 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor, 'Gate lowering, 12.0 dB off'"
msgid "Gate lowering, %1 dB off"
msgstr "噪声门正在降低，削减 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:162
msgctxt ""
"@info:status Voice Compressor, 'At the ceiling, compression and gate took off"
" 6.2 dB'"
msgid "At the ceiling, compression and gate took off %1 dB"
msgstr "已达上限，压缩和噪声门共削减 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@info:status a Voice Compressor that is switched off"
msgid "Switched off"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:166
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Compressor while its session is stopped"
msgid "Not playing"
msgstr "未播放"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:177
msgctxt "@info a reduction in decibels, '-6.2 dB'"
msgid "-%1 dB"
msgstr "-%1 dB"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:183
msgctxt ""
"@info Voice Compressor's settings on its tile: compression, then ceiling, "
"'-12 dB, ceiling -6'"
msgid "%1 dB, ceiling %2"
msgstr "%1 dB，上限 %2"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:189
msgctxt ""
"@info Voice Compressor's settings, 'Compression -12 dB, ceiling -6 dBFS'"
msgid "Compression %1 dB, ceiling %2 dBFS"
msgstr "压缩 %1 dB，上限 %2 dBFS"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:195
msgctxt "@info Voice Compressor's gate"
msgid "Gate off"
msgstr "噪声门关闭"

#: blocks/voicecompressor/ui/VoiceCompressorWords.qml:196
msgctxt "@info Voice Compressor's gate, 'Gate -50 dB'"
msgid "Gate %1 dB"
msgstr "噪声门 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:42
msgctxt "@info Voice Forward is switched off"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:45
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Turns down what differs between left and right. A sound that is alike on both"
" sides stays where it is"
msgstr "调低左右两侧不同的部分。两侧相同的声音保持不变"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardFace.qml:100
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:108
msgctxt "@label:slider how far Voice Forward turns the rest of the sound down"
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Finds what is alike on both sides of a stereo sound and turns the rest down. "
"At 0 dB, or switched off, the sound passes unchanged."
msgstr "找出立体声中两侧相同的部分，并把其余部分调低。设为 0 dB 或关闭时，声音原样通过。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A new block is set to 0 dB and changes nothing. Pull Background down on the "
"tile while people talk, until the voices sit where you want them. Switched "
"off, the sound is the input as it came, and it stays lined up with the "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"新模块设为 0 dB，不改变任何东西。在有人说话时，在图块上把“背景”往下拉，直到人声处于您想要的位置。关闭时，声音就是原样的输入，并且仍与画面保持同步。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"The block looks for what is alike on both sides, band by band. It does not "
"know what a voice is. A voice in the middle stays, and so do a kick drum, a "
"bass and a lead singer. A voice off to one side goes down with the rest. A "
"sound panned part-way can move towards the middle, and its quieter side can "
"get louder."
msgstr ""
"此模块逐个频段寻找两侧相同的部分。它并不知道什么是人声。居中的人声会保留，底鼓、贝斯和主唱也一样。偏向一侧的人声会与其余部分一起被调低。声像部分偏移的声音可能会向中间移动，它较轻的一侧也可能变响。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"While a good part of the voice band is in the centre the rest goes down by "
"Background. Otherwise it goes down by Between voices, so the room and the "
"music stay. A line's first syllable can come under the louder background, "
"since the block does not look ahead."
msgstr ""
"当人声频段中有相当一部分处于中央时，其余部分按“背景”调低；否则按“人声间隙”调低，从而保留环境声和音乐。由于此模块不会预先查看后面的声音，一句话的第一个音节可能会被较响的背景盖住。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A dB on the slider does not buy a dB. Taken out now shows what it really "
"does, often much less, and -24 dB is not far beyond -12 dB. It may sound "
"watery."
msgstr ""
"滑块上的 1 dB 并不等于实际减少 1 dB。“当前削减”显示它的实际效果，往往要小得多，而且 -24 dB 的效果并不比 -12 dB "
"强多少。声音听起来可能会有水波般的失真。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"On a mono sound both sides are alike, so between 100 Hz and 12 kHz there is "
"nothing to move, and the card says so. Under and over that the sound still "
"goes down, so a low rumble or a bass falls. With one side silent, or one side"
" in reversed polarity, everything counts as the rest."
msgstr ""
"对于单声道声音，两侧完全相同，因此在 100 Hz 到 12 kHz "
"之间没有可调整的内容，卡片会给出提示。在此范围以下和以上，声音仍会被调低，因此低沉的隆隆声或贝斯会减弱。如果一侧静音，或一侧极性反转，所有声音都会被算作其余部分。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"It holds the sound back by about 23 ms at 48 kHz, even at 0 dB. A wireless "
"link or another delay adds to that, and the sound can fall behind the "
"picture."
msgstr "在 48 kHz 下，即使设为 0 dB，它也会把声音延后约 23 ms。无线连接或其他延迟会在此基础上叠加，声音可能会落后于画面。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A limit at -1 dBFS stops peaks whenever the block changes anything. It is a "
"digital limit, not a level at your ears. At 0 dB, after the lift has gone, "
"the limit steps aside too, so nothing is changed at all."
msgstr ""
"只要模块做了任何改变，-1 dBFS 处的限制就会阻止峰值。这是数字限制，而不是您耳边的音量。设为 0 dB "
"时，在提升消失之后，限制也会退出，因此完全不做任何改变。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:35
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"For a film or a show in stereo, when music and effects cover the voices. Put "
"it after any other cleaning and levelling, and before One Ear Mix: after a "
"fold there is no left and right left to compare. Not for a game, where sounds"
" at the sides tell you where things are. No measurement here shows that it "
"helps anyone follow speech, and many people prefer the original."
msgstr ""
"适用于立体声的电影或节目，当音乐和音效盖过人声时。请把它放在其他所有清理和电平调整模块之后、单耳混音之前：两侧合并之后就不再有左右可供比较了。不适用于游戏，因为游戏中两侧的声音会告诉您东西在哪里。目前没有任何测量表明它能帮助人们听懂语音，而且很多人更喜欢原声。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How far the rest of the sound goes down while there is sound in the centre, "
"from 0 to -24 dB. The presets Music stays and Voices first set -6 dB and -15 "
"dB."
msgstr "中央有声音时，其余声音被调低的程度，范围从 0 到 -24 dB。预设“保留音乐”和“人声优先”分别设为 -6 dB 和 -15 dB。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:256
msgctxt "@title:group Voice Forward"
msgid "Between voices"
msgstr "人声间隙"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How far the rest goes down when the centre is quiet. The cut used stops at "
"Background. Set it to the same value as Background for one cut all the time."
msgstr "中央安静时，其余声音被调低的程度。实际使用的衰减不会超过“背景”。把它设为与“背景”相同的值，就能始终使用同一衰减。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:61
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:200
msgctxt "@option:check Voice Forward"
msgid "Hold level"
msgstr "保持电平"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"What is taken out makes the whole sound quieter. This raises it again, slowly"
" and by up to 6 dB, from the difference between the sound before and after. "
"It starts after 3 s, and it follows the quiet parts too, so the voices stand "
"out a little less. Leave it on when you compare, since the louder version "
"tends to win."
msgstr ""
"被削减的部分会让整体声音变轻。此选项根据处理前后声音的差异，把整体声音缓慢地重新调高，最多 6 dB。它在 3 "
"秒后开始，也会跟随安静的部分，因此人声会稍微不那么突出。比较时请保持开启，因为较响的版本往往听起来更好。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:68
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:129
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:154
msgctxt "@label how much lower Voice Forward has made the sound"
msgid "Taken out now"
msgstr "当前削减"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"How much lower this sound is now, before any lift. The white line is "
"Background."
msgstr "在任何提升之前，此声音当前降低了多少。白线表示“背景”。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:182
msgctxt "@label what Voice Forward's mask found"
msgid "Found now"
msgstr "当前检测"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:122
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Centre sound"
msgstr "居中声音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:120
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Wide sound"
msgstr "宽广声音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:79
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:124
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Both sides alike"
msgstr "两侧相同"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:80
#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:126
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward found"
msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "安静"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"One word from what the block found. Centre sound is what takes Background, "
"and Wide sound what takes Between voices. Both sides alike comes after five "
"seconds of nothing else. Quiet keeps the last cut."
msgstr ""
"用一个词表示模块检测到的情况。“居中声音”时使用“背景”，“宽广声音”时使用“人声间隙”。连续五秒没有其他情况时显示“两侧相同”。“安静”时保持上一次的衰减。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Press and hold it, or hold B with the focus in the card, on a talk scene with"
" music under it. Enter on the button keeps it on until the next Enter. It is "
"the block's real off state, so the picture does not move, and a level gap is "
"stated and not hidden: with Hold level off, a line says by how much."
msgstr ""
"在有背景音乐的对话场景中按住它，或在焦点位于卡片中时按住 B 键。在按钮上按 Enter 会使其保持开启，直到再次按 "
"Enter。这就是模块真正的关闭状态，因此声画同步不会改变；电平差异会如实显示而不会被掩盖：“保持电平”关闭时，会有一行文字说明相差多少。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"For a whole evening, fork the lane after the source and send one side through"
" Voice Forward and one straight to an Input Switch. The two stay lined up, "
"and the switch has a global shortcut that works over a full-screen film."
msgstr ""
"如果要用一整晚，请在音源之后把轨道分叉，一路经过人声突出，另一路直接送到输入切换模块。两路保持同步，而且输入切换模块有一个全局快捷键，在全屏播放电影时也能使用。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"A global shortcut can switch the block on and off. System Settings lists it "
"as Voice Forward on or off."
msgstr "可以用全局快捷键开启和关闭此模块。系统设置中将其列为“开启或关闭人声突出”。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Forward block"
msgid ""
"Headphones show the change more than laptop speakers. Try it on what you "
"really watch on."
msgstr "用耳机比用笔记本扬声器更能听出变化。请在您实际观看时使用的设备上试一试。"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:109
msgctxt "@label the unit of Background"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:115
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"How far the rest of the sound goes down while there is sound in the centre"
msgstr "中央有声音时，其余声音被调低的程度"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:132
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "How much lower this sound is now, before any lift"
msgstr "在任何提升之前，此声音当前降低了多少"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:204
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Slowly raises the whole sound by up to 6 dB, after what was taken out"
msgstr "在削减之后，把整体声音缓慢调高，最多 6 dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:236
msgctxt "@info while Hold for before is on"
msgid "Hearing the sound before this block"
msgstr "正在听此模块之前的声音"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:264
msgctxt ""
"@label:slider how far Voice Forward turns the sound down when the centre is "
"quiet"
msgid "Between voices"
msgstr "人声间隙"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:265
msgctxt "@label the unit of Between voices"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:271
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "How far the rest goes down when the centre is quiet"
msgstr "中央安静时，其余声音被调低的程度"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardPanel.qml:282
msgctxt "@info what Voice Forward can't do"
msgid ""
"Finds what is alike on both sides. It can't tell a voice from centred music "
"or a drum, and a voice off to one side goes down with the rest"
msgstr "找出两侧相同的部分。它无法区分人声与居中的音乐或鼓声，偏向一侧的人声也会与其余部分一起被调低"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:91
msgctxt "@label a Voice Forward tile, the setting has nothing to work on"
msgid "both sides alike"
msgstr "两侧相同"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:93
msgctxt "@label a Voice Forward tile, 'background · -3 now'"
msgid "background · %1 now"
msgstr "背景 · 当前 %1"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:98
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Voice Forward tile is"
msgid "background"
msgstr "背景"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:105
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:107
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未运行"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Not set. Sound passes unchanged"
msgstr "未设置。声音原样通过"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:111
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Nothing to move: both sides alike"
msgstr "无可调整：两侧相同"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:113
msgctxt "@info:status Voice Forward"
msgid "Working"
msgstr "工作中"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@info under Voice Forward's Hold level, 'Lifting +3 dB'"
msgid "Lifting %1"
msgstr "正在提升 %1"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@info under Voice Forward's Hold level, 'Lifting +3 dB. Limit acting'"
msgid "%1. Limit acting"
msgstr "%1。限制正在起作用"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:149
msgctxt ""
"@info under Voice Forward's Hold for before, 'Before is 4 dB louder than "
"this'"
msgid "Before is %1 dB louder than this"
msgstr "原声比当前响 %1 dB"

#: blocks/voiceforward/ui/VoiceForwardWords.qml:155
msgctxt "@info 'Adds 22.83 ms to this lane'"
msgid "Adds %1 ms to this lane"
msgstr "为此轨道增加 %1 ms 延迟"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeFace.qml:46
msgctxt "@info what a Voice Gauge tile says, '-24 LUFS, Between marks'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1，%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Shows the level of a voice at this point on the lane, in LUFS, against two "
"marks you place. It says where the reading stands against your marks, and "
"nothing about how you sound. It can be wrong."
msgstr "以 LUFS 显示轨道上此处人声的电平，并与您设置的两个标记对照。它只说明读数相对于标记的位置，不评价您的声音听起来如何。它也可能出错。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The block reads the lane and passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with "
"no delay. The number is the level over the last few seconds of voice. In a "
"pause the number stays and the word says Held, so it does not fall between "
"sentences."
msgstr ""
"此模块读取轨道，并将声音原样传递下去，没有延迟。数值是最近几秒人声的电平。停顿时数值保持不变，文字显示“已保持”，因此数值不会在句子之间下降。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The number moves with your voice, your distance from the microphone and the "
"microphone's gain, and the block can't tell them apart. It is a level at this"
" point on the lane, before the call program. The program's own gain and the "
"other side's volume come later."
msgstr ""
"数值会随您的嗓音、您与麦克风的距离以及麦克风的增益而变化，模块无法区分这几者。它是轨道上此处的电平，位于通话程序之前。程序自身的增益和对方的音量在此之后才起作用。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"No sound here means nothing has reached this point for 2 seconds. It can't "
"say why, and it can't see a mute inside a call program, which sits after this"
" block. To check, say a word and watch the dot: if it stays grey, the voice "
"is not reaching this point. If it lights, the sound got this far, and nothing"
" further is known."
msgstr ""
"“此处无声音”表示 2 "
"秒内没有任何声音到达此处。它无法说明原因，也看不到通话程序内部的静音，因为通话程序位于此模块之后。要检查，请说句话并观察圆点：如果圆点保持灰色，说明人声没有到达此处；如果圆点亮起，说明声音已到达这里，但无法得知更多情况。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A voice too soft for the detector is not counted, so the number stays Held at"
" its last value and the dot stays grey. Any voice counts, including one from "
"a loudspeaker or a television."
msgstr "检测器察觉不到的过轻人声不计入，因此数值会以“已保持”停留在上一个值，圆点保持灰色。任何人声都会计入，包括来自扬声器或电视的人声。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:34
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:166
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:176
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Gauge is called"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:146
msgctxt "@label what a Voice Gauge says now"
msgid "Now"
msgstr "当前"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"What the tile, the tray and the floating bar call this block, up to 24 "
"characters."
msgstr "图块、托盘和浮动条中显示的此模块名称，最多 24 个字符。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:196
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:223
msgctxt "@label the level of a voice over a few seconds"
msgid "Voice level"
msgstr "人声电平"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"The reading on a fixed scale from -60 to 0 LUFS, with a line at each mark. "
"The bar is one colour wherever it stands, and half as strong while the number"
" is held. A first number comes after 1 second of voice."
msgstr ""
"在 -60 到 0 LUFS 的固定刻度上显示读数，每个标记处有一条线。无论柱条位于何处，颜色都相同；数值保持时，颜色变淡一半。人声持续 1 "
"秒后出现第一个数值。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:252
msgctxt "@label a mark placed on a voice level"
msgid "Upper mark"
msgstr "上标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:268
msgctxt "@label a mark placed on a voice level"
msgid "Lower mark"
msgstr "下标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Two levels of your own, from -60 to -6 LUFS, or Not set. A word then says "
"where the reading stands against them, and it changes only half a unit past a"
" mark. The lower mark stays at least 1 LU under the upper one: moving one "
"past the other pushes it along. A block has no marks of its own, as a built-"
"in level would say what a voice should be."
msgstr ""
"您自己设定的两个电平，范围为 -60 到 -6 "
"LUFS，或“未设置”。随后会有文字说明读数相对于标记的位置，且读数越过标记半个单位后文字才会改变。下标记始终比上标记至少低 1 "
"LU：把其中一个移过另一个时，会推着另一个一起移动。模块本身不带标记，因为内置的电平就等于规定了人声应该是什么样。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:259
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Use This Level"
msgstr "使用此电平"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:66
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:304
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Clear Marks"
msgstr "清除标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"After 20 seconds of voice, this places an upper mark and a lower mark around "
"the level of that voice, Room each side apart from it. Only voice counts "
"towards the 20 seconds. Clear Marks takes both away."
msgstr ""
"人声累计 20 秒后，此按钮会在该人声电平的上下各放置一个标记，与该电平的距离为“两侧余量”。只有人声才计入这 20 秒。“清除标记”会同时移除两个标记。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"If someone is on a call with you, ask them to say when the level suits them, "
"and press Use This Level then. Marks hold for this microphone at this gain. "
"The card names the microphone they were placed on. Alone, the marks record "
"what you did for 20 seconds, and the block can't know more than that."
msgstr ""
"如果有人正在与您通话，请对方在觉得音量合适时告诉您，然后按“使用此电平”。标记只对这个麦克风在当前增益下有效。卡片会显示设置标记时所用的麦克风。如果只有您自己，标记记录的只是您那"
" 20 秒的表现，模块无法知道更多。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:324
msgctxt "@label how Voice Gauge listens"
msgid "Detector"
msgstr "检测器"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Voice model is a small model that runs on this computer. It needs a sound "
"system running at 48 kHz, and a build that has it. The card says so when one "
"is missing. Level and rhythm uses far less of the processor and can be wrong "
"more often."
msgstr ""
"“人声模型”是在本机上运行的小型模型。它需要以 48 kHz "
"运行的音频系统，以及包含该模型的构建版本。缺少其中任何一项时，卡片会给出提示。“电平与节奏”占用的处理器资源少得多，但更容易出错。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:388
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Floating bar"
msgstr "浮动条"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:90
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:381
msgctxt "@label where a Voice Gauge shows"
msgid "Show it on"
msgstr "显示位置"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:93
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A row with the number and the word in the small window that stays over other "
"programs, shared with Speech Now. There is room for four rows. It starts off,"
" and you can turn it on here or in the tray's popover. Drag the window to "
"move it. A full-screen share may show it, name included."
msgstr ""
"在始终位于其他程序之上的小窗口中显示一行，包含数值和文字；此窗口与说话指示共用。最多可容纳四行。此项初始为关闭，您可以在这里或托盘弹出窗口中将其开启。拖动窗口即可移动它。全屏共享时可能会显示它，包括其名称。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:101
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Adds this block to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray: a dot, the number and where it stands."
msgstr "将此模块添加到点击系统托盘中的 Reverblabr 图标时显示的内容中：一个圆点、数值及其所处位置。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:107
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:445
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Voice Gauge card"
msgid "Place the bar"
msgstr "浮动条位置"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:117
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid "The same place as Speech Now's label, since they share one window."
msgstr "与说话指示的标签位置相同，因为它们共用一个窗口。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:123
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:458
msgctxt "@label how many seconds of voice a reading is the mean of"
msgid "Reading over"
msgstr "读数时长"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:125
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:451
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the Voice Gauge card"
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "读数"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:128
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How many seconds of voice the number is the mean of, from 1 to 10. It starts "
"at 3. A shorter time follows you faster and wanders more. A rise shows sooner"
" than a fall, as a mean of energy favours the loud part."
msgstr ""
"数值取多少秒人声的平均值，范围为 1 到 10，初始为 3。时间越短，跟随越快，但波动也越大。上升比下降显示得更快，因为能量平均值更偏向响亮的部分。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:134
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:471
msgctxt "@label how long without a voice before a Voice Gauge starts again"
msgid "Forget after"
msgstr "无人声后重置"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:136
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How long without a voice before the block starts clean, from 10 to 600 "
"seconds, so that an old turn does not mix with a new one. It starts at 60 "
"seconds."
msgstr "多久没有人声后，模块会重新开始，范围为 10 到 600 秒，以免上一轮发言与新一轮混在一起。初始为 60 秒。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:142
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:487
msgctxt "@label how far either side of a level Use This Level puts the marks"
msgid "Room each side"
msgstr "两侧余量"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:144
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"How far Use This Level puts each mark from the level, from 1 to 9 LU. It "
"starts at 3. It does nothing to marks already placed."
msgstr "“使用此电平”将每个标记放在距该电平多远的位置，范围为 1 到 9 LU，初始为 3。它不影响已经设置好的标记。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:151
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"You can't judge your own level on a call, and only find out when someone says"
" so."
msgstr "通话时您无法判断自己的音量，只有别人告诉您时才知道。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:152
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"You want one answer from someone kept for later, as two marks for this "
"microphone."
msgstr "您希望把某人的一次反馈保存下来供以后使用，作为这个麦克风的两个标记。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:159
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Put it right after the microphone's Input Device, and name it You. With "
"nothing after it the call program keeps the real microphone, and a stopped "
"session costs the call nothing."
msgstr "把它直接放在麦克风的输入设备之后，并命名为“我”。它之后不连接任何模块时，通话程序仍使用真实的麦克风，会话停止也不会影响通话。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:160
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"Put it before Voice Evener. After Voice Evener the reading sits near that "
"block's target, and hides what the voice did. After Speech Denoise, a pause "
"can read as No sound here."
msgstr "把它放在人声调平之前。放在人声调平之后，读数会停留在该模块的目标附近，掩盖人声的实际变化。放在语音降噪之后，停顿可能显示为“此处无声音”。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:161
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"A Bluetooth headset drops to hands-free sound while anything records from it,"
" and a session left running holds it there outside calls too."
msgstr "只要有程序从蓝牙耳机录音，耳机就会降为免提音质；会话一直运行时，即使不在通话中，耳机也会保持这种状态。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:162
msgctxt "@info help page of the Voice Gauge block"
msgid ""
"With a screen reader, set a key for Say Voice Level in System Settings. One "
"press says one sentence, such as Minus 24 LUFS, between marks. Nothing is "
"said unasked."
msgstr ""
"使用屏幕阅读器时，请在“系统设置”中为“播报人声电平”设置一个按键。每按一次播报一句话，例如“负 24 "
"LUFS，在两个标记之间”。不按就不会播报任何内容。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:175
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "For example You"
msgstr "例如“我”"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:240
msgctxt "@info first use of a Voice Gauge"
msgid ""
"Talk as you do on a call. After 20 s of voice, Use This Level places two "
"marks around that level"
msgstr "像通话时那样说话。人声累计 20 秒后，“使用此电平”会在该电平两侧放置两个标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:253
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label loudness units"
msgid "LUFS"
msgstr "LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:258
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:274
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:281
msgctxt "@info a mark with no value"
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未设置"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:316
msgctxt "@info the microphone the marks were placed on, %1 its name"
msgid "Marks placed on: %1"
msgstr "标记设置于：%1"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:403
msgctxt "@info under the Floating bar check box"
msgid "This desktop may not keep it on top"
msgstr "此桌面可能无法让它保持在最上层"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:415
msgctxt "@info under the Floating bar check box"
msgid "The window has room for four. %1 more is left out."
msgid_plural "The window has room for four. %1 more are left out."
msgstr[0] "窗口最多可容纳四个。另有 %1 个未显示。"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:488
msgctxt "@label loudness units"
msgid "LU"
msgstr "LU"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:500
msgctxt "@info what Voice Gauge can't know"
msgid ""
"A level at this point, before the call program. It can't see a mute inside "
"that program, or what the other side hears. A voice from a loudspeaker counts"
" too"
msgstr "这是此处的电平，位于通话程序之前。它看不到该程序内部的静音，也无法得知对方听到的声音。来自扬声器的人声也会计入"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:135
msgctxt "@info a level, '-24 LUFS'"
msgid "%1 LUFS"
msgstr "%1 LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:145
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:230
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge has no number yet"
msgid "No reading yet"
msgstr "尚无读数"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:147
msgctxt "@info nothing reaches a Voice Gauge"
msgid "No sound here"
msgstr "此处无声音"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:149
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:233
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge that cannot hear its lane"
msgid "Not watching"
msgstr "未监听"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:151
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:235
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge that is switched off"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "已关闭"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:158
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands"
msgid "Between marks"
msgstr "在两个标记之间"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:160
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands"
msgid "Above upper mark"
msgstr "高于上标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:162
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands"
msgid "Below upper mark"
msgstr "低于上标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands"
msgid "Above lower mark"
msgstr "高于下标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:166
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands"
msgid "Below lower mark"
msgstr "低于下标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:168
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge has no marks"
msgid "No marks set"
msgstr "未设置标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:175
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands, inside a sentence"
msgid "between marks"
msgstr "在两个标记之间"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:177
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands, inside a sentence"
msgid "above upper mark"
msgstr "高于上标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:179
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands, inside a sentence"
msgid "below upper mark"
msgstr "低于上标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:181
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands, inside a sentence"
msgid "above lower mark"
msgstr "高于下标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:183
msgctxt "@info where a voice level stands, inside a sentence"
msgid "below lower mark"
msgstr "低于下标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:185
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge has no marks, inside a sentence"
msgid "no marks set"
msgstr "未设置标记"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:194
msgctxt "@info a held reading and where it stands, 'Held · between marks'"
msgid "Held · %1"
msgstr "已保持 · %1"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:198
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge waiting for a first second of voice"
msgid "Talk to start"
msgstr "说话即可开始"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:199
msgctxt "@info sound reaches a Voice Gauge and it hears no voice"
msgid "Sound, no voice"
msgstr "有声音，无人声"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:201
msgctxt "@info under No sound here"
msgid "At this point"
msgstr "在此处"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:216
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge whose session is not running"
msgid "Session stopped"
msgstr "会话已停止"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:223
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "Voice at this point"
msgstr "此处有人声"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:225
msgctxt "@info a Voice Gauge keeps its number through a pause"
msgid "Held"
msgstr "已保持"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:227
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "No sound at this point"
msgstr "此处没有声音"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:231
msgctxt "@info what arrives at a Voice Gauge"
msgid "Sound at this point, no voice"
msgstr "此处有声音，无人声"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:241
msgctxt "@info a level and where it stands, '-24 LUFS, between marks'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1，%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:251
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, a level below zero"
msgid "Minus %1 LUFS"
msgstr "负 %1 LUFS"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:253
msgctxt "@info:status spoken, a level and where it stands"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1，%2"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:260
msgctxt "@action:button %1 counts up to 20 seconds of voice"
msgid "Use This Level (%1 of 20 s)"
msgstr "使用此电平（%1/20 秒）"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:264
msgctxt "@info how long a reading runs"
msgid "%1 s of voice"
msgstr "%1 秒人声"

#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeWords.qml:272
msgctxt "@info a room either side of a level"
msgid "±%1 LU"
msgstr "±%1 LU"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeFace.qml:109
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Volume tile is"
msgid "gain"
msgstr "增益"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeFace.qml:134 blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:92 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:163
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "音量"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Makes the sound that passes through it quieter, or louder. Use it to match "
"one source to another, without touching the program the sound comes from."
msgstr "让经过它的声音变轻或变响。可用它让一个音源与另一个匹配，而无需改动声音来源的程序。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Everything that reaches this block leaves it at the volume you set. At 100 % "
"the sound goes on exactly as it arrived. Lower numbers make it quieter, and 0"
" % is silence."
msgstr "到达此模块的所有声音都会以您设定的音量离开。设为 100% 时，声音原样传递下去。数值越低声音越轻，0% 为静音。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"At 50 % the signal has half its strength. It sounds clearly quieter, though "
"to the ear it is not half as loud."
msgstr "设为 50% 时，信号强度减半。听起来明显变轻了，但对耳朵来说并没有轻一半。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so moving the slider never "
"makes a click."
msgstr "更改会在五十分之一秒内平滑过渡，因此移动滑块不会产生咔嗒声。"

#. i18n: "full scale" is the highest level digital sound can have; the sentence
#. after explains it.
#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"At the end of the block a safety limiter is always at work. It keeps the "
"sound from going higher than 1 dB below full scale."
msgstr "模块末端始终有一个安全限幅器在工作。它让声音不会超过比满刻度低 1 dB 的电平。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Full scale is the loudest a digital signal can be. Sound pushed past it is "
"clipped: the tops of its waves are cut off, and it crackles. The limiter "
"turns the loudest moments down just enough instead."
msgstr "满刻度是数字信号所能达到的最大响度。超过它的声音会被削波：波形的顶部被削掉，并产生噼啪声。而限幅器只把最响的瞬间压低到刚好合适的程度。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"While the sound stays below that level, the limiter changes nothing. It only "
"holds the sound back by one and a half thousandths of a second, far too "
"little to hear."
msgstr "只要声音保持在该电平以下，限幅器就不做任何改变。它只会让声音延迟千分之一点五秒，短到根本听不出来。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"How loud the sound leaves the block, as a percentage of how loud it arrived. "
"Drag the slider here or on the block's tile; the number shows where it is."
msgstr "声音离开模块时的响度，以到达时响度的百分比表示。可在此处或模块的图块上拖动滑块；数字会显示当前位置。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A new block starts at 100 %. Without Overdrive the slider stops at 100 %, so "
"it can only turn the sound down."
msgstr "新模块的初始值为 100%。不开启“音量增强”时，滑块最高为 100%，因此只能调低声音。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:46 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:134
msgctxt "@action:button silence this block"
msgid "Mute"
msgstr "静音"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Silences the block without moving the slider. Press it again and the sound "
"comes back at the volume the slider shows."
msgstr "让模块静音而不移动滑块。再按一次，声音会以滑块所示的音量恢复。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"The sound fades out and in over a hundredth of a second, so muting in the "
"middle of a word makes no click."
msgstr "声音会在百分之一秒内淡出和淡入，因此在说一个词的中途静音也不会产生咔嗒声。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"The slider still moves while the block is muted. Use it to set the level the "
"sound will come back at."
msgstr "模块静音时滑块仍可移动。可用它设定声音恢复时的电平。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:56 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:198
msgctxt "@label how far above 100 % the volume slider goes"
msgid "Overdrive"
msgstr "音量增强"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Lets the slider go past 100 %, so the block can make the sound louder than it"
" arrived. 2× takes the top of the slider to 200 %, 3× to 300 % and 4× to 400 "
"%. Off keeps it at 100 %."
msgstr ""
"让滑块可以超过 100%，这样模块就能让声音比到达时更响。2× 将滑块上限提高到 200%，3× 提高到 300%，4× 提高到 400%。“关”则保持在"
" 100%。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Choosing an overdrive does not change what you hear. It only gives the slider"
" more room."
msgstr "选择音量增强倍数并不会改变您听到的声音，只会给滑块更大的范围。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"If you choose a smaller overdrive while the volume is above its top, the "
"volume comes down to the new top."
msgstr "如果在音量高于新上限时选择了较小的增强倍数，音量会降到新的上限。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"Sound made louder can reach the safety limiter. The loudest moments are then "
"held down rather than clipped, which can make loud music sound flatter."
msgstr "被调响的声音可能会触及安全限幅器。这时最响的瞬间会被压住而不是被削波，这可能让响亮的音乐听起来更扁平。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "One program is much louder than another in the same session."
msgstr "在同一个会话中，一个程序比另一个程序响得多。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"A quiet microphone needs to be louder before it reaches a recording or a "
"call. Turn on Overdrive for that."
msgstr "音量较小的麦克风在进入录音或通话之前需要调响。为此请开启“音量增强”。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"You want to silence one lane for a moment, with Mute, while the rest of the "
"session carries on."
msgstr "您想用“静音”让一条轨道暂时无声，而会话的其余部分照常进行。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "Put a Peak/RMS meter after the block to see what your change did."
msgstr "在此模块之后放一个峰值/RMS 电平表，查看您的更改产生了什么效果。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:78
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid ""
"When you turn a quiet source up, go a step at a time. If the meter after it "
"keeps reaching the red part at the top, back off a little."
msgstr "调高较轻的音源时，请一步一步来。如果其后的电平表不断达到顶部的红色区域，请稍微调回一点。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeHelp.qml:79
msgctxt "@info help page of the Volume block"
msgid "Ctrl+Z takes back a change of the volume, like any other change."
msgstr "和其他任何更改一样，按 Ctrl+Z 可以撤销音量的更改。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:54
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Overdrive raises the top of the slider, not the volume. Turning it down "
"brings the volume with it."
msgstr "“音量增强”提高的是滑块的上限，而不是音量。调低它时，音量也会随之降低。"

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@label how far above 100 % the volume slider goes"
msgid "Overdrive:"
msgstr "音量增强："

#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:235
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The volume slider goes up to %1 %"
msgstr "音量滑块最高可达 %1%"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info the two needles' readings, 'L −3.0 VU, R −2.5 VU'"
msgid "L %1, R %2"
msgstr "L %1，R %2"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:54 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@info a VU needle resting on its pin, 'Below −20 VU'"
msgid "Below %1 VU"
msgstr "低于 %1 VU"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:57 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:70
msgctxt "@info a VU reading"
msgid "%1 VU"
msgstr "%1 VU"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:19
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Shows how loud the sound is at this point of a lane with two needles, one for"
" the left side and one for the right. It only measures: the sound passes "
"through unchanged."
msgstr "用两根指针显示轨道中这一点的声音有多响，一根代表左侧，一根代表右侧。它只做测量：声音原样通过。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Each needle swings with the average loudness of its side, the way the needle "
"meters on old tape machines and mixing desks did. It does not jump to every "
"short peak. It moves smoothly, more like the way the ear judges loudness."
msgstr ""
"每根指针都随所在一侧的平均响度摆动，就像老式磁带录音机和调音台上的指针表那样。它不会对每个短暂的峰值都跳动，而是平稳地移动，更接近耳朵判断响度的方式。"

#. i18n: VU stands for volume unit; it stays in Latin letters in most
#. languages.
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"The scale is in VU, short for volume units. 0 VU is the level you choose with"
" 0 VU is. The scale runs from −20 VU, where the needle rests on its pin, to "
"+3 VU at its end; the part above 0 VU is red."
msgstr ""
"刻度以 VU 为单位，VU 是“音量单位”的缩写。0 VU 对应的是您在“0 VU 对应”中选择的电平。刻度从 −20 "
"VU（指针停靠在挡针上的位置）到末端的 +3 VU；高于 0 VU 的部分为红色。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Like a real VU meter's, the scale follows the strength of the sound rather "
"than decibels. So 0 VU sits about seven tenths of the way along, and the "
"quiet end from −20 to −10 VU is crowded together."
msgstr ""
"与真正的 VU 表一样，刻度依据声音的强度而不是分贝来划分。因此 0 VU 大约位于全程的十分之七处，而从 −20 到 −10 VU "
"的安静一端则挤在一起。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"A needle takes three tenths of a second to reach a new level, and swings a "
"hair past it before it settles, as the standard for these meters asks."
msgstr "指针需要十分之三秒才能到达新的电平，并会在稳定前稍微越过一点，这正是此类仪表的标准所要求的。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"The small lamp by each dial lights red when that side reaches full scale, the"
" loudest a digital signal can be. The sound has probably been clipped there: "
"the tops of its waves were cut off, which you may hear as a crackle. The "
"light stays on for a second and a half after the last time; click the dial to"
" put it out sooner."
msgstr ""
"当某一侧达到满刻度（数字信号所能达到的最大响度）时，对应表盘旁的小灯会亮红色。这时声音很可能已经削波：波形的顶部被削掉了，您可能会听到噼啪声。小灯在最后一次削波后会继续亮一秒半；点击表盘可以让它提前熄灭。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "Point at a dial to read its level as a number, to a tenth of a VU."
msgstr "将鼠标悬停在表盘上，即可以数字读取其电平，精确到十分之一 VU。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "The block adds no delay and changes nothing in the sound."
msgstr "此模块不会增加延迟，也不会改变声音。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:41 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:174
msgctxt "@label:listbox the level that reads 0 VU"
msgid "Reference level"
msgstr "参考电平"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:43 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:160
msgctxt "@label:listbox the level that reads 0 VU"
msgid "0 VU is"
msgstr "0 VU 对应"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Which level the needle shows as 0 VU. Click the value beside 0 VU is to "
"choose another. The number is how far below full scale the peaks of a steady "
"tone are when the needle points at 0 VU:"
msgstr ""
"指针显示为 0 VU 的是哪个电平。点击“0 VU 对应”旁边的值即可选择其他电平。这个数值表示当指针指向 0 VU 时，稳定音调的峰值比满刻度低多少："

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−20 dBFS: the same sound reads 2 VU higher than at −18, which leaves more "
"room below full scale."
msgstr "−20 dBFS：同样的声音读数比 −18 时高 2 VU，在满刻度以下留出更多余量。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−18 dBFS: what a new block uses, and the level digital studios most often "
"line 0 VU up with."
msgstr "−18 dBFS：新模块使用此值，也是数字录音室最常用来对齐 0 VU 的电平。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block, one choice of the reference level"
msgid ""
"−14 dBFS: the same sound reads 4 VU lower than at −18, for sound that is "
"meant to be loud."
msgstr "−14 dBFS：同样的声音读数比 −18 时低 4 VU，适用于本来就要很响的声音。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"dBFS means decibels below full scale. Changing the reference moves the "
"needles only; the sound stays exactly as it is."
msgstr "dBFS 表示低于满刻度的分贝数。更改参考电平只会移动指针；声音完全保持原样。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:62
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"Adds this meter to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray. You can then keep an eye on the level with the main window "
"closed."
msgstr "把此电平表添加到点击系统托盘中 Reverblabr 图标时显示的内容里。这样即使关闭主窗口，您也能随时留意电平。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "It is off for a new block."
msgstr "新模块默认关闭此项。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"You want to judge how loud a voice or a piece of music feels, rather than how"
" high its peaks go."
msgstr "您想判断一段人声或音乐听起来有多响，而不是它的峰值有多高。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"You want two sources to sound about equally loud: set each so its needle "
"swings round the same place."
msgstr "您想让两个音源听起来差不多一样响：调整每个音源，使其指针在同一位置附近摆动。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid "You find a calm needle easier to read than a jumping bar."
msgstr "您觉得平稳的指针比跳动的柱条更容易读。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:79
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"For speech, aim for the needle to swing round 0 VU, touching the red now and "
"then."
msgstr "对于语音，目标是让指针在 0 VU 附近摆动，偶尔触及红色区域。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:80
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"A VU needle is too slow to show short peaks. To be sure nothing clips, put a "
"Peak/RMS meter beside it, or watch the lamps."
msgstr "VU 指针太慢，显示不出短暂的峰值。要确保没有削波，请在旁边放一个峰值/RMS 电平表，或留意指示灯。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the VU block"
msgid ""
"If a lamp keeps lighting, turn down whatever comes before the meter until it "
"stays dark."
msgstr "如果指示灯不断亮起，请调低电平表之前的声音，直到指示灯不再亮。"

#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:83
msgctxt "@info:tooltip a VU reading, and that the side has clipped"
msgid "%1, clipped — click to reset"
msgstr "%1，已削波——点击重置"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info a Wave block making noise rather than a tone"
msgid "Noise"
msgstr "噪声"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:51
msgctxt "@info a waveform and the one side it is on, 'sine · left'"
msgid "%1 · %2"
msgstr "%1 · %2"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:56
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what a Wave block is making, 'Sine, 1 kHz, −18.0 dB, both'"
msgid "%1, %2, %3, %4"
msgstr "%1，%2，%3，%4"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:59
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what a Wave block is making, 'White noise, −18.0 dB, both'"
msgid "%1, %2, %3"
msgstr "%1，%2，%3"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveFace.qml:117 blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:70
#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:182
msgctxt "@label:slider how loud a Wave block's signal is"
msgid "Level"
msgstr "电平"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Makes a test sound: a steady tone or a hiss of noise, at the pitch and the "
"level you set, on the left, the right or both sides."
msgstr "产生测试声音：按您设定的音高和电平，在左侧、右侧或两侧发出稳定的音调或嘶嘶声般的噪声。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The block makes its own sound and takes nothing in. It is listed with the "
"outputs, but it starts a lane: wire it to an Output Device to hear it, or "
"through other blocks first to see what they do."
msgstr ""
"此模块自己产生声音，不接收任何输入。它列在“输出”分类中，但它是一条轨道的起点：用连线把它接到输出设备即可听到，或者先让它经过其他模块，看看它们有什么作用。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"A known, steady sound is what you need to check a speaker, a cable or a "
"setting. You always know what should come out."
msgstr "要检查扬声器、线缆或某项设置，需要一个已知且稳定的声音。这样您总能知道应该输出什么。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Every change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so changing the pitch, "
"the level or the side never makes a click."
msgstr "每次更改都会在五十分之一秒内平滑过渡，因此更改音高、电平或声道时绝不会产生咔嗒声。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:34 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:91
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Waveform"
msgstr "波形"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:36 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Sine"
msgstr "正弦波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:37 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:30
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Square"
msgstr "方波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:38 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:32
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Triangle"
msgstr "三角波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:39 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:34
msgctxt "@item a waveform"
msgid "Sawtooth"
msgstr "锯齿波"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:40 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:36
msgctxt "@item a kind of noise"
msgid "White noise"
msgstr "白噪声"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:41 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:38
msgctxt "@item a kind of noise"
msgid "Pink noise"
msgstr "粉红噪声"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"What the sound is. The first four are tones, each with a pitch; the last two "
"are noise, with none."
msgstr "声音的种类。前四种是音调，各有音高；后两种是噪声，没有音高。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Sine: the purest tone, a single pitch and nothing else. What a new block "
"makes, and the usual test tone."
msgstr "“正弦波”：最纯净的音调，只有单一音高，没有其他成分。新模块默认产生这种声音，它也是常用的测试音。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Square, Triangle and Sawtooth: the same pitch with other tones above it, so "
"they sound brighter and buzzier. Triangle is the softest of the three, and "
"Square and Sawtooth the harshest. They are made so that a high pitch never "
"brings a false, lower tone with it."
msgstr ""
"“方波”、“三角波”和“锯齿波”：同样的音高，上方还带有其他音，因此听起来更明亮、更有嗡嗡感。三角波是三者中最柔和的，方波和锯齿波最刺耳。它们经过特别处理，高音调时绝不会带出虚假的较低音。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"White noise: a hiss with every pitch in it at once, at the same strength. It "
"sounds bright and sharp."
msgstr "“白噪声”：同时包含所有音高且强度相同的嘶嘶声。听起来明亮而尖锐。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block, a choice of Waveform"
msgid ""
"Pink noise: noise with the high pitches turned down, which sounds more even "
"to the ear, like rushing water. It is the usual noise for checking speakers."
msgstr "“粉红噪声”：调低了高音调的噪声，在耳朵听来更均匀，像流水声。它是检查扬声器常用的噪声。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:56 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:125
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "频率"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:57 blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:149
msgctxt "@label:textbox a frequency to type"
msgid "Frequency in hertz"
msgstr "频率（Hz）"

#. i18n: Hz stands for hertz, kHz for kilohertz.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The pitch of a tone, in hertz (Hz): how many times a second the wave repeats."
" The slider goes from 20 Hz, a deep rumble, to 20 kilohertz (kHz), 20,000 Hz,"
" higher than most adults can hear. A new block starts at 1 kHz."
msgstr ""
"音调的音高，单位为赫兹（Hz）：即波形每秒重复多少次。滑块范围从 20 Hz（低沉的隆隆声）到 20 千赫兹（kHz），即 20,000 "
"Hz，高于大多数成年人能听到的范围。新模块从 1 kHz 开始。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The slider spreads the range the way the ear hears it: each step up in pitch,"
" from one note to the same note an octave higher, takes the same distance "
"anywhere on it."
msgstr "滑块按耳朵的听感来分布这一范围：音高每升高一个八度（从一个音到高八度的同名音），在滑块上任何位置都占相同的距离。"

#. i18n: keep 440, 1k and 1.5 kHz as they are; they are what is typed.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"For an exact pitch, type it in the box beside the slider and press Enter: 440"
" for 440 Hz, or 1k or 1.5 kHz for kilohertz."
msgstr "要输入精确的音高，请在滑块旁的框中输入并按 Enter：输入 440 表示 440 Hz，输入 1k 或 1.5 kHz 表示千赫兹。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Noise has no pitch, so the frequency is greyed out while the block makes "
"noise. It is kept for when you go back to a tone."
msgstr "噪声没有音高，因此此模块产生噪声时，频率显示为灰色。该值会保留下来，供您切换回音调时使用。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"How loud the sound is, in decibels (dB) below full scale, the loudest a "
"digital signal can be. 0 dB is full scale, and every 6 dB lower is about half"
" the strength. The slider goes from −80 dB, barely there, to 0 dB."
msgstr ""
"声音有多响，以低于满刻度（数字信号所能达到的最大响度）的分贝数（dB）表示。0 dB 即满刻度，每降低 6 dB，强度约减半。滑块范围从 −80 "
"dB（几乎听不到）到 0 dB。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"The level is the height of the wave's peaks. A new block starts at −18 dB, "
"well below full scale, so that a test is never loud unless you ask for loud."
msgstr "电平是波形峰值的高度。新模块从 −18 dB 开始，远低于满刻度，因此除非您有意调响，测试声音绝不会很响。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Above −6 dB the number turns to the warning colour. A loud steady tone can "
"hurt your ears or a small speaker, so go up a little at a time."
msgstr "高于 −6 dB 时，数字会变成警告颜色。响亮而持续的音调可能伤害您的耳朵或小型扬声器，因此请每次只调高一点。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@label which channels a Wave block's signal is on"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "声道"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:83 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:46
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to the left channel only"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左声道"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:84 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:50
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to both channels"
msgid "Both"
msgstr "左右声道"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:85 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:48
msgctxt "@item the signal goes to the right channel only"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右声道"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Which side the sound is on. Left or Right puts it on that side only, and the "
"other side is silent. Both, what a new block uses, puts the same sound on "
"each side."
msgstr "声音在哪一侧。“左声道”或“右声道”只把声音放在该侧，另一侧无声。“左右声道”（新模块默认使用）在两侧放相同的声音。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"You want to check that a speaker works, or that left and right are the right "
"way round."
msgstr "您想检查扬声器是否正常工作，或者左右是否接对。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid "You want to know whether a cable or an adapter crackles or hums."
msgstr "您想知道线缆或转接头是否有噼啪声或嗡嗡声。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"You want to see what a block does to a sound you know, with a meter after it."
msgstr "您想在模块之后接一个电平表，看看它对已知的声音有什么作用。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:104
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Turn your speakers or headphones down before you start, then bring the level "
"up slowly."
msgstr "开始前请先调低扬声器或耳机的音量，然后慢慢调高电平。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"To check left and right, choose Left: the sound should come only from the "
"left speaker. Then choose Right."
msgstr "要检查左右，请选择“左声道”：声音应该只从左扬声器发出。然后再选择“右声道”。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"Pink noise at a modest level is a good sound to compare two speakers with, or"
" to set the volumes of several to match."
msgstr "电平适中的粉红噪声很适合用来比较两只扬声器，或把多只扬声器的音量调成一致。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WaveHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the Wave block"
msgid ""
"A sweep from low to high, with the slider, shows where a small speaker stops "
"playing the bass."
msgstr "用滑块从低到高扫频，可以看出小型扬声器从哪里开始放不出低音。"

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:83
msgctxt "@label:listbox the shape of a Wave block's signal"
msgid "Waveform:"
msgstr "波形："

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:114
msgctxt "@label a Wave block's tone frequency"
msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "频率："

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:172
msgctxt "@label how loud a Wave block's signal is"
msgid "Level:"
msgstr "电平："

#: blocks/wave/ui/WavePanel.qml:213
msgctxt "@label which channels a Wave block's signal is on"
msgid "Channels:"
msgstr "声道："

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:15
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Draws the sound at this point on the lane as it goes by. It changes nothing "
"about the sound."
msgstr "在声音经过轨道上的这一点时将其绘制出来。它不会改变声音。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:20
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"The block passes the sound on exactly as it arrived, with no delay. Its tile "
"and its card both draw what passes, at their own width, and it works only "
"while one of them is on the screen."
msgstr "此模块会原样传递声音，没有延迟。它的图块和卡片都会按各自的宽度绘制经过的声音，并且只有当其中之一显示在屏幕上时才会工作。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"A trace that stands still is one you asked to hold. When the session is "
"stopped or overloaded, or the block is off, no trace is shown and a line of "
"words says why."
msgstr "静止不动的迹线是您要求保持的迹线。当会话已停止或过载，或者模块已关闭时，不会显示迹线，并会有一行文字说明原因。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:31
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:110
msgctxt "@action:button keeps the trace shown and takes no new one"
msgid "Hold"
msgstr "保持"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:33
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Keeps the trace on the screen and takes no new ones, so that you can look at "
"a moment. You can change how it is drawn while it is held. Press it again to "
"go back to the live sound."
msgstr "把迹线保留在屏幕上，不再获取新的迹线，便于您查看某一时刻。保持期间可以更改绘制方式。再按一次即可回到实时声音。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"The settings below are folded under this heading, under the trace and Hold. "
"Click the heading to show them, and again to fold them away."
msgstr "下面的设置收在这个标题之下，位于迹线和“保持”下方。点击标题可展开设置，再次点击则收起。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@label how a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Line draws the wave itself, or the band it fills when more than one sample "
"falls on a pixel. Filled draws how far the sound reaches either side of the "
"middle, as a solid shape. Bars does the same in separate bars, and Dots marks"
" the highest and lowest points. Switching shows at once."
msgstr ""
"“线条”绘制波形本身；当一个像素上落有多个采样时，则绘制其填满的带状区域。“填充”以实心形状绘制声音在中线两侧所达到的范围。“柱状”以分开的柱条表现同样的内容，“点”则标出最高点和最低点。切换后立即生效。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:174
msgctxt "@label how a Waveform moves between refreshes"
msgid "Motion"
msgstr "移动方式"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Real-time shows the newest sound as it is, once each refresh, and holds it "
"until the next."
msgstr "“实时”在每次刷新时按原样显示最新的声音，并保持到下一次刷新。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Smooth draws at the rate of your screen. From 200 ms up the trace flows "
"steadily across, a little behind the newest sound. Below 200 ms, or with the "
"trigger on, each new trace eases in from the last, lined up on a rising zero "
"crossing so that a steady tone stands still. Smooth makes the picture calmer "
"and uses more of the graphics card."
msgstr ""
"“平滑”按屏幕的刷新率绘制。在 200 ms 及以上时，迹线会平稳地横向流动，略落后于最新的声音。低于 200 ms "
"或开启触发时，每条新迹线会从上一条平滑过渡而来，并对齐到上升过零点，使稳定的音调保持静止。“平滑”让画面更平稳，但会占用更多显卡资源。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:73
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:214
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:221
msgctxt "@label how many times a second a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "Refresh rate, per second"
msgstr "每秒刷新次数"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"How often a new look is taken at the sound, from 10 to 120 times a second. It"
" can't show more than arrives, which is one cycle of the sound system at a "
"time, and the card says so when the rate you chose is faster than that. It "
"can't show more than your screen does either."
msgstr ""
"多久获取一次声音的新画面，范围从每秒 10 次到 120 "
"次。它无法显示比实际到达更多的内容，而声音是以音频系统的周期为单位逐个到达的；如果您选择的速率比这更快，卡片会给出提示。它也无法显示超过您屏幕刷新能力的内容。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:81
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label how much time a Waveform shows across its width"
msgid "Time shown"
msgstr "显示时长"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"How much time goes across the width, from 10 ms to 10 s. A short time shows "
"the shape of a wave, and a long time shows how the level moves. A click stays"
" visible even at 10 s."
msgstr ""
"整个宽度所显示的时长，范围从 10 ms 到 10 秒。时长较短时可显示波的形状，较长时可显示电平的变化。即使在 10 秒时，咔嗒声也仍然可见。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:89
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:284
msgctxt "@label how much a Waveform's trace is enlarged"
msgid "Gain"
msgstr "增益"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:91
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:296
msgctxt "@option:check a Waveform enlarges its trace to fill the height"
msgid "Auto fit"
msgstr "自动适应"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Enlarges the drawing and not the sound, from -24 to +48 dB. With Auto fit on,"
" the trace is enlarged to fill the height: at once when it would go off the "
"edge, and over about a second when it gets quieter."
msgstr ""
"放大的是图形而不是声音，范围从 -24 到 +48 dB。开启“自动适应”时，迹线会被放大以填满高度：即将超出边缘时立即调整，变轻时则在约一秒内调整。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:100
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:307
msgctxt "@label which channels a Waveform draws"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "声道"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:110
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Both draws left and right over each other, and Stacked draws left above "
"right. Mid is what the two have in common, half of their sum, and Side is "
"where they differ, half of their difference. A mono sound has no Side."
msgstr ""
"“左右重叠”把左右声道重叠绘制，“上下排列”把左声道绘制在右声道上方。“中间”是两者的共同部分，即两者之和的一半；“侧边”是两者的差异，即两者之差的一半。单声道声音没有“侧边”。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:116
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:346
msgctxt ""
"@option:check a Waveform starts each trace at the same point of the wave"
msgid "Start on a rising zero crossing"
msgstr "从上升过零点开始"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Starts each trace where the wave goes up through the middle, so that a steady"
" tone stands still rather than running across. It helps with a tone or a held"
" note. On speech or music there are many crossings and the trace still moves."
" It looks at the first channel shown."
msgstr ""
"让每条迹线从波形向上穿过中线的位置开始，使稳定的音调保持静止，而不是横向移动。它对音调或持续的音符很有帮助。对于语音或音乐，过零点很多，迹线仍会移动。它以显示的第一个声道为准。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:124
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:370
msgctxt "@option:check lines behind a Waveform's trace"
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Lines behind the trace: eight divisions across, and the middle with half "
"height up and down."
msgstr "迹线后方的线条：横向分为八格，并有中线以及上下各半高处的线。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:132
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:381
msgctxt "@label what the height of a Waveform means"
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "刻度"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Linear makes the height the amplitude, which is how a wave looks. Decibels "
"spreads the last 60 dB over the height, so that quiet sound can be seen, with"
" a line every 12 dB."
msgstr "“线性”让高度表示振幅，也就是波形本来的样子。“分贝”把最后 60 dB 铺满整个高度，让安静的声音也能看见，每 12 dB 画一条线。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:145
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"Put one before and one after a block to see what it does to the shape of the "
"sound. Use a short time with the trigger on to look at a tone, and a long "
"time to see how the level moves."
msgstr "在某个模块之前和之后各放一个，即可看到它对声音形状的影响。查看音调时使用较短的时长并开启触发，要观察电平变化时则使用较长的时长。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:152
msgctxt "@info help page of the Waveform block"
msgid ""
"A session can show up to 16 at once. Each one still passes the sound on with "
"no delay, and one that is off the screen does no work beyond passing it on. A"
" held trace is kept only while the tile or the card is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"一个会话最多可同时显示 16 个。每个都仍然无延迟地传递声音，不在屏幕上的除了传递声音外不做任何工作。保持的迹线只有在图块或卡片显示在屏幕上时才会保留。"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:90
msgctxt "@label the sound drawn on a Waveform card"
msgid "Waveform"
msgstr "波形"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:113
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Keeps the trace on the screen so that you can look at it"
msgstr "把迹线保留在屏幕上，便于查看"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:238
msgctxt "@action:button how many times a second a Waveform is drawn"
msgid "%1 times a second"
msgstr "每秒 %1 次"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:256
msgctxt "@info under a Waveform's refresh rate, %1 a whole number"
msgid ""
"Sound arrives about %1 times a second at this cycle length, so a faster "
"refresh repeats itself"
msgstr "在此周期长度下，声音每秒约到达 %1 次，因此更快的刷新只会重复画面"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:285
msgctxt "@label decibels"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:360
msgctxt "@info under a Waveform's trigger"
msgid "No crossing found: the newest sound is shown as it comes"
msgstr "未找到过零点：按原样显示最新的声音"

#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:422
msgctxt "@info what a Waveform does to the sound"
msgid ""
"Passes the sound on exactly as it arrived. The block works only while it is "
"on the screen"
msgstr "原样传递声音。此模块仅在显示于屏幕上时工作"

#. i18n: typed in KRunner after "rb" to see what is being recorded; three
#. letters of it or more, or all of it
#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:160
msgctxt "@info:keyword KRunner"
msgid "recording"
msgstr "录音"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:168
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Running and recording"
msgstr "正在运行并录音"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:169
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:172
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Starting"
msgstr "正在启动"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:175
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Stopping"
msgstr "正在停止"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:178
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Could not run"
msgstr "无法运行"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:181
msgctxt "@info:status session state in KRunner"
msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:313
msgctxt "@action:button in KRunner"
msgid "Open in Reverblabr"
msgstr "在 Reverblabr 中打开"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:336
msgctxt "@info KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Recording in “%1”"
msgstr "“%1”正在录音"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:337
msgctxt "@info KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Recording paused in “%1”"
msgstr "“%1”的录音已暂停"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:348
msgctxt "@info KRunner"
msgid "Nothing is being recorded"
msgstr "没有正在进行的录音"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:381
msgctxt "@action KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Stop “%1”"
msgstr "停止“%1”"

#: daemon/sessionrunner.cpp:382
msgctxt "@action KRunner, %1 is a session's name"
msgid "Run “%1”"
msgstr "运行“%1”"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:71
msgctxt "@item a device or application whose name is not known"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:84
msgctxt "@action:button in a notification that a recording finished"
msgid "Open"
msgstr "打开"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:89
msgctxt "@action:button in a notification that a recording finished"
msgid "Show in Folder"
msgstr "在文件夹中显示"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:132
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Plugin stopped"
msgstr "插件已停止"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:135
msgctxt "@info %1 is a plugin's name"
msgid ""
"%1 crashed. Its block is bypassed, and it can be restarted from its panel."
msgstr "%1 已崩溃。其模块已被旁路，可从其面板重新启动它。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:138
msgctxt "@info %1 is a plugin's name"
msgid ""
"%1 stopped responding. Its block is bypassed, and it can be restarted from "
"its panel."
msgstr "%1 无响应。其模块已被旁路，可从其面板重新启动它。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:144
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Disk nearly full"
msgstr "磁盘即将写满"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:146
msgctxt "@info %1 is a recording's file name; %2 is an amount of disk space"
msgid ""
"Only %2 is left on the disk %1 is recorded to. The recording goes on, and "
"stops cleanly before the disk is full."
msgstr "%1 所在的磁盘仅剩 %2 空间。录音会继续，并在磁盘写满前正常停止。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:152
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Feedback prevented"
msgstr "已阻止反馈回路"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:154
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A connection would have fed a session's sound back into itself, so it wasn't "
"made."
msgstr "某个连接会把会话的声音反馈回其自身，因此未建立该连接。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:170
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Device disconnected"
msgstr "设备已断开"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:172
msgctxt "@info %1 is a device's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid ""
"%1 went away while %2 was running. The session waits for it and carries on "
"when it is back."
msgstr "%2 运行时，%1 断开了连接。会话会等待它，并在它恢复后继续。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:181
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Application stopped playing"
msgstr "应用程序已停止播放"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:183
msgctxt "@info %1 is an application's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid "%1 is no longer playing into %2."
msgstr "%1 不再向 %2 播放。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:193
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Application playing again"
msgstr "应用程序恢复播放"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:195
msgctxt "@info %1 is an application's name; %2 is a session's name"
msgid "%1 is playing into %2 again."
msgstr "%1 重新开始向 %2 播放。"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:211
msgctxt "@title a notification"
msgid "Recording finished"
msgstr "录音已完成"

#: notify/notifications.cpp:213
msgctxt "@info %1 is a recording's file name; %2 how long it is, as 1:05"
msgid "%1 is saved, %2 long."
msgstr "%1 已保存，时长 %2。"
